        "TileImage": "$($repository f2efb273-d0a8-4442-8cea-8a3ac205cfc6).Image",
        "Description": "Your target is disgruntled janitor Sebastian Mattson. We have reason to believe he plans to place bombs in the Milton-Fitzpatrick bank and kill everyone inside. He is inside the bank working his scheduled shift. Intel shows the bomb has a failsafe: if the janitor doors open, the bomb will disarm itself. The door is locked, and Mattson has the key. Take out the son of a bitch, retrieve the key, and disarm that bomb, 47! And you better hurry, 47. The bomb is set to blow in less than a minute!",
